# Escape The Room (George Vicarey): full win, 17 steps. Draw contents need the draw examined first (x desk, x draw a/b/c); selotape+shredded paper -> paper, pencil+numerals -> paper with code; mallet smashes the mirror; plain 'unlock safe' (key in inventory), then 'unlock door'.
x desk
x draw a
take shredded paper
x draw b
take selotape
take pencil
x draw c
x scratched numerals
use selotape on shredded paper
use pencil on scratched numerals
x fridge
take mallet
use mallet on mirror
x safe
unlock safe
take key
unlock door
